window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Eva is being hunted.</p> <p>Whether it's by her obsessive ex or a murderer stalking her through the streets of New York, there's danger around every corner.</p> <p>But she can survive it all as long as she has Damon, Mason, and Beckham . . . right? When disaster strikes, and Eva is left all alone to pick up the pieces, Eva will have to discover what's really inside of her.</p> <p>Can Eva discover who she is and unlock the keys to her past in time to save herself and the ones she loves?</p> <p>Or will the bond between Eva and her men be broken forever.</p> <p>And when Eva discovers who she really is . . . will it actually set her free?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
